From 6a94a9e1411f351af9ee8581537864b1897ad67b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 09:20:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): stabilize contained-strand clock and close
 review gaps [daveey]

Use the archive transition rather than later comments for archived authorities. Skip chat link scans for already escalated episodes. Show containment age while the authority is open. Exercise replica-only authority status, retained home/worker copies, unresolved holds and producer/run boundaries.
